   "title": "Trump says he may meet with Kim Jong-un while in China",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/world/20261117/trump-says-he-may-meet-with-kim-jong-un-while-in-china",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
