   "title": "Zamfara PDP deputy governorship aspirant, others defect to APC",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/zamfara-pdp-deputy-governorship-aspirant-others-defect-to-apc/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
