   "title": "Indo-ASEAN ties at the heart of India’s Act East Policy, PM says ahead of ASEAN summit in Manila",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/prime-minister-narendra-modi-manila-asean-india-summit-east-asia-summit/article71706657.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
   "source": "thehindu.com",
