   "title": "EXIM Bank-funded cashew factory targets 33,000-tonne annual processing capacity",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/exim-bank-funded-cashew-factory-targets-33000-tonne-annual-processing-capacity/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
   "source": "MyJoyOnline（加纳）",
