   "title": "Pulmuone Food & Culture opens first overseas catering operation in US",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/companies/20261116/pulmuone-food-culture-opens-first-overseas-catering-operation-in-us",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
